      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-02-23T16:40:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As you say, no shuffling of the trash into the deck, since it doesn't say to do that. &nbsp;There's just no Infection coming into play. &nbsp;However, I think it says to shuffle the deck after you search, right? &nbsp;If so, then you'd still shuffle the deck even if you didn't find (or didn't bother looking because you knew it wasn't there) an Infection card. &nbsp;That could be important if some hero or effect had allowed you to look at the top card of the villain deck, for example. &nbsp;Since you have to shuffle it, that card you were counting on being next would now be roaming freely in the villain deck again.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:27:35.188Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
