      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>As you say, no shuffling of the trash into the deck, since it doesn&#39;t say to do that. &nbsp;There&#39;s just no Infection coming into play. &nbsp;However, I think it says to shuffle the deck after you search, right? &nbsp;If so, then you&#39;d still shuffle the deck even if you didn&#39;t find (or didn&#39;t bother looking because you knew it wasn&#39;t there) an Infection card. &nbsp;That could be important if some hero or effect had allowed you to look at the top card of the villain deck, for example. &nbsp;Since you have to shuffle it, that card you were counting on being next would now be roaming freely in the villain deck again.</p>",
